{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S01、S05这类18–19秒的短停留段，感受说明仍然偏长；如果只想快速扫一眼，X右侧的短词更容易掠过。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"平\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把叙事中的关键转折加亮，感受紧跟对应的话句，观众更容易抓住每段发生了什么，以及人物为什么产生这样的反应。感受还具体对应音乐的起伏、音色和情绪变化，并用水波、小船、光线等意象贯穿前后，形成连续的体验。X的短词确实便于快速浏览，但比较像并列的情绪标签，感受与人物心理的对应关系、细节展开和前后递进都不如Y清楚。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9d0ef3b9-a864-45fd-8076-2c382980103a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T032022437217Z", "elapsed_seconds": 45.093, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T03:21:07.545087+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e363cfb3beac582df76fc4e7fc29b6f7f3fd4c8d3dce774dce9331697aaef02a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "